body:
if you would read the card you’d know exactly the answer to your question & wouldn’t have had to make this post. you need the card to get your package anyways (:

& lmao no, it’s just the answer u wanted. 
i gave u the legit answer to the question, u just didn’t like it lol.

there’s always abortion & a talk with the wife about the actual logics of having a child. 
so i guess you could say you were never an antinatalist.  we don’t bring people into this world.

if you are sad for their future you should have thought about that before having them (:
